Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.06,0:00:01.39,Caption,,0,0,0,,Number one: the
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.40,0:00:01.67,Caption,,0,0,0,,end of
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.68,0:00:02.50,Caption,,0,0,0,,a guardrail.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.92,0:00:03.98,Caption,,0,0,0,,A plain rail
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.00,0:00:05.20,Caption,,0,0,0,,end is dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.62,0:00:06.18,Caption,,0,0,0,,Hit it head
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.20,0:00:07.09,Caption,,0,0,0,,on and it
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.10,0:00:08.06,Caption,,0,0,0,,doesn't give way.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.52,0:00:09.58,Caption,,0,0,0,,It spears right
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.60,0:00:10.46,Caption,,0,0,0,,into the cabin.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.88,0:00:11.57,Caption,,0,0,0,,So the end
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.58,0:00:12.41,Caption,,0,0,0,,gets a steel
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.43,0:00:13.36,Caption,,0,0,0,,head that slides
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.38,0:00:14.19,Caption,,0,0,0,,down the rail.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.61,0:00:16.47,Caption,,0,0,0,,Inside, it squeezes
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.49,0:00:17.52,Caption,,0,0,0,,the rail flat
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.63,0:00:18.17,Caption,,0,0,0,,and bends it
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.19,0:00:18.86,Caption,,0,0,0,,away in a
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.88,0:00:20.10,Caption,,0,0,0,,long steel ribbon.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.52,0:00:21.75,Caption,,0,0,0,,Crushing steel takes
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.77,0:00:22.94,Caption,,0,0,0,,a huge force,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.28,0:00:24.13,Caption,,0,0,0,,and that force
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.14,0:00:24.99,Caption,,0,0,0,,is what slows
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.00,0:00:25.61,Caption,,0,0,0,,the car.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.03,0:00:26.94,Caption,,0,0,0,,The posts near
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.95,0:00:27.80,Caption,,0,0,0,,the end snap
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.81,0:00:29.01,Caption,,0,0,0,,off, so nothing
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.03,0:00:30.14,Caption,,0,0,0,,snags the wheels.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.56,0:00:31.76,Caption,,0,0,0,,Sixty to zero
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.78,0:00:32.54,Caption,,0,0,0,,in about two
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.56,0:00:33.86,Caption,,0,0,0,,car lengths, and
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.87,0:00:34.47,Caption,,0,0,0,,the cabin
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.48,0:00:35.37,Caption,,0,0,0,,is untouched.
